and pedestrians to ginormous bosses threatening to be even evilier than you!\n\n# Upgrade your powers.\nSpend your hard earned cash to upgrade your powers. Each power has a unique upgrade tree, pick different paths to customize your build!\n\n{900881772796736}\n\n# Team up with friends.\nHang out with your friends, race each other with superpowers, or team up to fight giant bosses. Show everyone all your cool cosmetics!\n\n# Join our Discord.\nSuper City is just getting started, there\u2019s a lot of new content coming soon. Tell us what you\u2019d like us to add next! https://discord.gg/tqPj7xvdRP\n", "short_description": "Master superpowers and fly through the city! Team up with your friends in online multiplayer, and work together to destroy the city, fight enemies, and collect cash. Prove you\u2019re the strongest supervillain in Super City! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.locomotiondevs.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Locomotion Devs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://locomotiondevs.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "25404867029199135"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED",